From: arena-ai-coding-agent <arena-ai-coding-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 06:40:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Fix subagent model inheritance after disabling official
 DeepSeek adapter

In-process subagents were inheriting the create-time agent options, which
still pointed at deepseek-official even though the product patch removed
that adapter from the active composition. Delegated children therefore
failed with 'no adapter registered for provider deepseek-official' even
when the parent session was using an available provider.

- Repoint the agent-default-model composition entry from the removed
  deepseek-official route to the pi-ai deepseek route for the same model
  family.
- Resolve child agent provider/model/maxTokens from the parent session's
  latest request header (the live route actually used) before falling
  back to creation-time options, so subagent delegations follow the
  session model selection instead of a stale deployment default.
