+ /**
+- * Resolve the child's `AgentOptions`: the parent's provider/model/maxTokens
++ * Resolve the child's `AgentOptions`: the parent's live provider/model/maxTokens
+  * route unless the request overrides it, stamped with the child's own
+  * delegation depth.
++ *
++ * The live route comes from the parent session's latest request header — the
++ * route the parent actually used for its last completed request. Creation-time
